Khmer Unicode Layout for External Keyboard
==========================================

This application contains work from the projects below. Their notices are
reproduced here as their licences require.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Android Open Source Project, and Socheat.net
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

app/src/main/res/raw/keyboard_layout_khmer.kcm derives from the key character
map shipped by the original "Khmer Unicode Layout for External Keyboard"
application (http://app.socheat.net), which itself derives from AOSP key
character maps.

