Khmer Angkor keyboard, SIL Global
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The NiDA key table in tools/nida_layout.json was extracted by
tools/parse_kmn.py from the key/output stores of the Khmer Angkor keyboard
(https://github.com/keymanapp/keyboards, release/k/khmer_angkor), and
app/src/main/res/raw/keyboard_layout_khmer.kcm is generated from it.

